. * nwdynam tutorial 3: what a small event log can and cannot tell you
. * Requires the core nwcommands and the package nwdynam.
. * The data (manufacturing company emails) are loaded from the web.
. 
. * --- a ten-event toy log (the example of the help file) ---
. clear

. input sender receiver t

        sender   receiver          t
  1. 1 2 1
  2. 1 3 2
  3. 2 1 3
  4. 1 2 4
  5. 3 2 5
  6. 2 3 6
  7. 1 3 7
  8. 3 1 8
  9. 2 1 9
 10. 1 3 10
 11. end

. nwset sender receiver, directed eventtime(t) name(chat)

. nwdynam chat
cannot compute an improvement -- flat region encountered
------------------------------------------------------------
Dynamic Network Actor Model - choice sub-model (MLE)
Network: chat                          Actors: 3
Events: 10                             Log likelihood:   -3.9890
------------------------------------------------------------
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
        chat | Coefficient  Std. err.      z    P>|z|     [95% conf. interval]
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
     inertia |  -16.95435   4803.848    -0.00   0.997    -9432.324    9398.415
       recip |  -.6931435   1.224744    -0.57   0.571    -3.093598    1.707311
       indeg |  -19.78143   13962.73    -0.00   0.999    -27386.22    27346.66
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note: no usable standard error for inertia indeg.
      These effects are probably not identified (too few events, a perfectly
      predicted pattern, or effects that are linear functions of each other). Do
      not interpret their estimates; drop or recode the effect.

. 
. * --- the real log: the first 60 events, then more, up to all 631 of the first f
> ive days ---
. * (the same 154 employees in the risk set every time)
. nwwebuse manufacturing_nodes, nwclear
(plain Stata dataset loaded - not a saved network file; build a network from it
directly, e.g. with nwfromedge or nwgenerate)

. quietly levelsof label, local(everyone) clean

. nwwebuse manufacturing, nwclear
(plain Stata dataset loaded - not a saved network file; build a network from it
directly, e.g. with nwfromedge or nwgenerate)

. keep if t < 5
(49,602 observations deleted)

. tempfile all

. save `all'
file /var/folders/hx/2zp2k5ps2y7d_6hx015fcr1h0000gn/T//S_75967.000001 saved as
    .dta format

. foreach n in 60 150 300 631 {
  2.     use `all', clear
  3.     keep in 1/`n'
  4.     quietly levelsof sender, local(a) clean
  5.     quietly levelsof receiver, local(b) clean
  6.     local seen : list a | b
  7.     local without : list everyone - seen
  8.     local miss
  9.     foreach e of local without {
 10.         local miss `miss',`e'
 11.     }
 12.     local miss = substr("`miss'", 2, .)
 13.     nwset sender receiver, directed eventtime(t) name(first`n')
 14.     nwaddnodes first`n', nodenames(`miss')
 15. }
(Manufacturing company emails, 2010 (Nurek and Michalski 2020; CC0))
